              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kodumut inya luelibito ejok, kolal akwap kiyamakina, kinapakina da; naarai lueboioto kaŋina apeŋo keraas luka Kam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
