          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ice kakesi, kes odwe luka Simeon, ituŋa akwat akany, koloto moru Seir, ikapolokitokokee kes Pelatia, ka Nearia, ka Repaia, ka Usi el, odwe luka Isi. ",
          "type": "text",
